sp {mind*conflicting-testimony
 (state <s> ^context <c>) (<c> ^frame <f> ^mental-record <r> ^next <n>)
 (<f> ^mode perceive ^evidence <e>)
 (<e> ^class belief ^source heard ^value <value> ^provenance <root> ^speaker <speaker> ^time <t>) (<n> ^status <> unknown ^value <> <value>)
 --> (<c> ^revision <v>)
 (<v> ^status disputed ^conflict <value> ^reason conflicting-evidence ^coping verify ^emotion uncertain ^intensity 30 ^tension 12)
}
