 (state <s> ^context <c>) (<c> ^frame <f> ^mental-record <r> ^next <n>)
 (<f> ^mode perceive ^evidence <e>)
 (<e> ^class social ^value << cooperate promise praise >> ^value <value> ^provenance <root> ^speaker <speaker> ^time <t>) (<n> ^judgment <j>)
 --> (<c> ^revision <v>)
 (<v> ^value <value> ^status known ^provenance <root> ^informant <speaker> ^at <t> ^source heard ^reason observed-cooperation ^emotion grateful ^intensity 28 ^tension 0 ^trust-value (+ <j> 3) ^coping reciprocate ^conflict none)
