 (<v> ^value brokenPromise ^status known ^provenance <root> ^informant <speaker> ^at <t> ^source heard ^reason explicit-commitment-broken ^emotion angry ^intensity (+ 38 <sen>) ^tension 35 ^trust-value (- <j> 8) ^coping <style> ^conflict none)
}
