 (state <s> ^context <c>) (<c> ^frame <f> ^mental-record <r> ^next <n>)
 (<f> ^mode perceive ^evidence <e>)
 (<e> ^class social ^value refuse ^explanation constrained ^provenance <root> ^speaker <speaker> ^time <t>)
 --> (<c> ^revision <v>)
 (<v> ^value refuse ^status known ^provenance <root> ^informant <speaker> ^at <t> ^source heard ^reason known-conflicting-duty ^emotion disappointed ^intensity 12 ^tension 5 ^coping defer ^conflict none)
