 (state <s> ^context <c>) (<c> ^frame <f> ^mental-record <r> ^next <n>)
 (<f> ^mode perceive ^evidence <e>)
 (<e> ^class social ^value refuse ^explanation unknown ^provenance <root> ^speaker <speaker> ^time <t>) (<f> ^goal-relevant no)
 --> (<c> ^revision <v>)
 (<v> ^value refuse ^status tentative ^provenance <root> ^informant <speaker> ^at <t> ^source heard ^reason cause-not-known ^emotion uncertain ^intensity 15 ^tension 8 ^coping verify ^conflict none)
