sp {mind*refusal-threatens-goal
 (state <s> ^context <c>) (<c> ^frame <f> ^mental-record <r> ^next <n>)
 (<f> ^mode perceive ^evidence <e>)
 (<e> ^class social ^value refuse ^explanation unknown ^provenance <root> ^speaker <speaker> ^time <t>) (<f> ^goal-relevant yes ^energy <energy>) (<n> ^judgment <j>) (<c> ^sensitivity <sen> ^style <style>)
 --> (<c> ^revision <v>)
 (<v> ^value refuse ^status tentative ^provenance <root> ^informant <speaker> ^at <t> ^source heard ^reason own-goal-obstructed-cause-uncertain ^emotion frustrated ^intensity (+ 20 <sen> (/ (- 100 <energy>) 10)) ^tension 25 ^trust-value (- <j> 2) ^coping <style> ^conflict none)
